    },
    "message": "Move the staff's assignment and edge capacities into the kernels\n\nassign_operations and relief plan a start from the rows and write it one record at a time, and\nwait_snapshot reads the routes of a free worker. assign_none hands the step to assign_work without\na refusal. _route counts the trips under way and records a capacity wait; a rule that plans holds\nthat record and reserves its sequence. The driver calls the receipts and the complaints directly.\nResults do not change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
